    "body": "Yeah, my original concern was that some terminals don't actually support italic styles (in fact, some terminals do funky stuff like inverting the background/foreground colors to indicate italic font).\r\n\r\nThat being said, some terminal emulators don't support bold either (e.g. my Linux emulator of choice, Kitty), so that probably shouldn't be a showstopper.",
